flowchart TD
    A[Requester submits request] --> B{Required data valid?}
    B -- No --> A
    B -- Yes --> C[Status: Submitted]
    C --> D[Determine category, SLA, and approver]
    D --> E[Send approval]
    E --> F{Approved?}
    F -- No --> G[Status: Rejected<br/>Capture comments and notify requester]
    F -- Yes --> H[Status: Approved]
    H --> I[Assign coordinator]
    I --> J[Status: In Progress]
    J --> K{Completed?}
    K -- No --> L[SLA monitoring and escalation]
    L --> J
    K -- Yes --> M[Status: Completed]
    M --> N[Notify requester and write activity log]